#. ~ Description of variant "A Short History of the Jewish People: From
#. Legendary Times to Modern Statehood" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A survey-level study of Jewish history, from Biblical times through to the "
"1990s.  At only 250 pages long, it is by necessity very brief on any "
"individual topic."
