msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of variant "When Bad Things Happen to Good People" of item
#. "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A meditation on meaningless tragedy and why the disaster and sorrow in the "
"world is unevenly distributed.  Written decades before the Cataclysm, but the"
" author was obviously on to something."
msgstr ""

