#. "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A history of the development of Rabbinic Judaism, from the Jewish Revolt in "
"the first century to the writing of the Mishnah, and how Judaism and "
"Christianity fully separated."
msgstr ""

