"An ecologically-minded take on modern homemaking, a practical guide to "
"maximizing your time in the kitchen and beyond."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Rooms We Love"
#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
msgid ""
"A guide on how to affordably decorate rooms to suit your personality.  In the"
" book, we visit rooms inspired by the needs of each homeowner and will see "
