"A collection of essays and advice on style, beauty, and motherhood.  Part "
"memoir, part lifestyle guide, this book reflects the author's experience "
"growing up as a woman of color in Brooklyn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Using Art to Treat Eating Disorders"
#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
